{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The following structure ensures packages work optimally with our monorepo/Nx workflow."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"package-json","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"./package.json"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All TanStack projects have "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"type\": \"module\""},{"type":"text","value":" to set the default resolution of "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".js"},{"type":"text","value":" files to ESM; this does not have any impact on building for CJS"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It is also essential to have an "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"exports\""},{"type":"text","value":" field"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"For legacy reasons, you should also include the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"main\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"module\""},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"types\""},{"type":"text","value":" fields"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All packages have the following scripts which are cached by Nx: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"test:eslint\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"test:types\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"test:lib\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"build\""},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"test:build\""}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tsconfig-json","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"./tsconfig.json"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Extends the root-level tsconfig (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"extends\": \"../../tsconfig.json\""},{"type":"text","value":")"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add any framework-specific options and included files here"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"src","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"./src"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This folder should only include code which gets built and shipped to users"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tests should not be placed in this folder, as they bloat the shipped code, and can unintentionally invalidate the Nx cache"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tests","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"./tests"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This folder should include all test files"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It should also include any test setup files required by that framework"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tsdown-config-ts","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"./tsdown.config.ts"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defines "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tsdown"},{"type":"text","value":" config, including any framework-specific plugins."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"vitest-config-ts","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"./vitest.config.ts"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defines config for Vitest"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"package-json","text":"./package.json","level":3},{"id":"tsconfig-json","text":"./tsconfig.json","level":3},{"id":"src","text":"./src","level":3},{"id":"tests","text":"./tests","level":3},{"id":"tsdown-config-ts","text":"./tsdown.config.ts","level":3},{"id":"vitest-config-ts","text":"./vitest.config.ts","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe following structure ensures packages work optimally with our monorepo/Nx workflow.\n\n### `./package.json`\n\n- All TanStack projects have `\"type\": \"module\"` to set the default resolution of `.js` files to ESM; this does not have any impact on building for CJS\n- It is also essential to have an `\"exports\"` field\n- For legacy reasons, you should also include the `\"main\"`, `\"module\"`, and `\"types\"` fields\n- All packages have the following scripts which are cached by Nx: `\"test:eslint\"`, `\"test:types\"`, `\"test:lib\"`, `\"build\"`, `\"test:build\"`\n\n### `./tsconfig.json`\n\n- Extends the root-level tsconfig (e.g. `\"extends\": \"../../tsconfig.json\"`)\n- Add any framework-specific options and included files here\n\n### `./src`\n\n- This folder should only include code which gets built and shipped to users\n- Tests should not be placed in this folder, as they bloat the shipped code, and can unintentionally invalidate the Nx cache\n\n### `./tests`\n\n- This folder should include all test files\n- It should also include any test setup files required by that framework\n\n### `./tsdown.config.ts`\n\n- Defines `tsdown` config, including any framework-specific plugins.\n\n### `./vitest.config.ts`\n\n- Defines config for Vitest\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: package-structure\ntitle: Package Structure\n---\n\nThe following structure ensures packages work optimally with our monorepo/Nx workflow.\n\n### `./package.json`\n\n- All TanStack projects have `\"type\": \"module\"` to set the default resolution of `.js` files to ESM; this does not have any impact on building for CJS\n- It is also essential to have an `\"exports\"` field\n- For legacy reasons, you should also include the `\"main\"`, `\"module\"`, and `\"types\"` fields\n- All packages have the following scripts which are cached by Nx: `\"test:eslint\"`, `\"test:types\"`, `\"test:lib\"`, `\"build\"`, `\"test:build\"`\n\n### `./tsconfig.json`\n\n- Extends the root-level tsconfig (e.g. `\"extends\": \"../../tsconfig.json\"`)\n- Add any framework-specific options and included files here\n\n### `./src`\n\n- This folder should only include code which gets built and shipped to users\n- Tests should not be placed in this folder, as they bloat the shipped code, and can unintentionally invalidate the Nx cache\n\n### `./tests`\n\n- This folder should include all test files\n- It should also include any test setup files required by that framework\n\n### `./tsdown.config.ts`\n\n- Defines `tsdown` config, including any framework-specific plugins.\n\n### `./vitest.config.ts`\n\n- Defines config for Vitest\n"}
